{"id":"wb-4-193","name":"贺兰山岩画","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"贺兰山岩画","text":"贺兰山岩画，是对分布在中华人民共和国宁夏回族自治区贺兰山中的一系列岩画的总称。这些岩画的分布范围北至石嘴山市，南至中卫市，题材以人面像和游牧生活为主，其中还有部分西夏文。这些岩画最早于1969年被发现，1996年时被列为全国重点文物保护单位。由于技术原因，这些岩画的最早出现时间至今无法得到确定。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B4%BA%E5%85%B0%E5%B1%B1%E5%B2%A9%E7%94%BB","revisionId":92706879,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92706879","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/332adb7717263c43a275c98e.jpg","title":"Helan_Mountain’s_rock_paintings.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Helan_Mountain%E2%80%99s_rock_paintings.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Helan_Mountain%E2%80%99s_rock_paintings.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Phlins Chen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​Helan Mountain’s rock paintings in 2025","width":320,"height":240}}